GOAL: identical behaviour, readable code.
FILE: src/dev/DeveloperDiagnostics.ts, src/dev/PresentationMinimap.ts, src/dev/LaunchOptions.ts only.
CONTEXT: each file currently holds its whole class/function on one long line — DeveloperDiagnostics (FPS overlay, F1/F2/F3 hotkeys, frame(), dispose(), private render()), PresentationMinimap (canvas widget with update(bounds, points)), parseLaunchOptions(search) returning {debug, courseId?, hole?}. Tests live in src/dev/dev.test.ts.
CONSTRAINTS: formatting only — do NOT rename anything, do NOT change exported names, hotkey codes, CSS class names ('dev-diagnostics', 'dev-minimap'), rendered strings, canvas sizes or logic; do not touch any other file, including src/dev/index.ts. Use 2-space indentation, one statement per line, one class member per line.
